# 🚗 GuardianCar — Smart Anti-Theft IoT System  
### Built by **StackWave** | Hackathon 2025

GuardianCar is an intelligent vehicle-theft prevention system that alerts the owner **instantly when the car starts**, and allows a **one-tap response**:

- **YES, it’s me**  
- **NOT ME → Safe Immobilise + Live Tracking**  
- **Track Vehicle**

This repo contains the **ESP32 code**, **backend simulator**, and **presentation materials** used in the hackathon.

---

## 🎯 Features

- 🚨 Ignition detection
- 📲 Real-time mobile alert (via Firebase / Blynk / IFTTT)
- 🛑 Safe Immobilisation (only when speed ≤ 3 km/h)
- 📍 GPS tracking simulation
- 🔧 Pending immobilise queue
- 📝 Event logs
- 🔒 Safety + fail-safe logic

---

## 🧩 Tech Stack

- **Hardware:** ESP32 DevKit V1  
- **Simulation Inputs:** Analog speed, button ignition  
- **Dashboard Options:** Firebase / Blynk / IFTTT  
- **Backend:** Local Python/Node simulator  
- **App:** React Native / Blynk App

